# Talent Acquisition Executive (Template)

**Location:** [City] | **Work mode:** [On-site / Hybrid] | **Type:** Full-time
**Experience:** [X–Y] years in recruitment

## About the role

We are looking for a talent acquisition executive to support hiring across [IT / non-IT / specific functions]. You will manage the process from intake to offer and make sure candidates and hiring managers have a smooth experience.

## Responsibilities

- Take intake calls with hiring managers and write clear job descriptions
- Source candidates through job portals, professional networks and referrals
- Screen resumes and run first-round calls
- Schedule interviews and keep hiring managers and candidates updated
- Maintain trackers and candidate records in the ATS
- Follow up with candidates through the offer and joining stages

## Required skills

- Experience in end-to-end recruitment
- Boolean search and portal sourcing (LinkedIn, Naukri or similar)
- Clear written and spoken communication
- Good organisation and follow-up

## Good to have

- Experience hiring for technical roles
- Familiarity with an ATS
- Basic recruitment reporting

## Education

Graduate in any discipline. An MBA in HR is a plus.
